        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobi",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobi, also known as just Shadow Dancer, is a side-scrolling action game produced by SEGA that was originally released for the SEGA Genesis in 1990. It has been re-released via downloading services such as the Wii's Virtual Console and Steam in 2010. It was also included in the Sega Genesis Collection for the PlayStation 2 and PlayStation Portable but it was omitted in PAL version (Sega Mega Drive Collection).\n\nIt is the second game in the Shinobi series released for the Mega Drive, following The Revenge of Shinobi. However, it is not a continuation of the previous game, but rather a loose adaptation to the 1989 arcade game Shadow Dancer. Like in the original arcade game, the player controls a ninja followed by a canine companion. The Secret of Shinobi was well received by critics.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobi, también conocido simplemente como Shadow Dancer, es un juego de acción de desplazamiento lateral producido por SEGA, lanzado originalmente para SEGA Genesis en 1990. Fue reeditado mediante servicios de descarga como la Consola Virtual de Wii y Steam en 2010. También se incluyó en Sega Genesis Collection para PlayStation 2 y PlayStation Portable, pero se omitió en la versión PAL (Sega Mega Drive Collection).\n\nEs el segundo juego de la serie Shinobi lanzado para Mega Drive, tras The Revenge of Shinobi. Sin embargo, no es una continuación del juego anterior, sino una adaptación libre del juego arcade de 1989 Shadow Dancer. Al igual que en el juego arcade original, el jugador controla a un ninja acompañado por un compañero canino. The Secret of Shinobi fue bien recibido por la crítica.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1990",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
